# ==============================================================================
# AURA PORTAL - LOCAL & PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' for local development:
#   copy .env.example .env
#
# Fill in your real credentials from your Supabase Project Dashboard.
# NEVER commit your real '.env' file to GitHub.
